factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  Reel script says the 183.85 kg tobacco seizure was from the shop in Madukkarai, but the article says it relates to Rajkumar's stash; the shop tip-off and seizure location are conflated with the Singanallur seizure in a way that is not clearly stated.
  Reel script states Rajkumar was 'ஆவுடையார்கோவிலைச் சேர்ந்த' and 39 years old; the article gives age as 39 with a possibly garbled number (39 in the text, 'சிறையில் அடைத்தனர்'), so the age attribution is an inference not clearly supported.
  Reel script and slides say Rajkumar was 'சிறையில் அடைக்கப்பட்டார்' with the age directly attached as his descriptor, mixing two facts into one sentence.
  Caption and reel script state Savarimuthu was 'கைது', but the article says 'சவரிமுத்துவை, 55 கைது செய்தனர்' with age 55 presented as an unexplained number; the age attribution is inferred.
  Slide 3 says 'சிங்காநல்லூர் போலீசார் கைது' and 'சிங்காநல்லூர்' title, but the article's seizure relates to Singanallur police without a clear location of the seizure, creating a location claim not stated in the article.
  Slide 4 and reel script say the 10 people were arrested in 'கோவை மாநகரில்' across 7 police station limits; the article says 'மாநகர எல்லைக்குட்பட்ட 7 போலீஸ் ஸ்டேஷன் எல்லைகளில்' which matches, but the reel script's 'வழக்குப் பதியப்பட்டது' drops the plural subject and the 'அனைவரும் பிணையில்' is consistent; however the headline/hl1 uses 'மதுக்கரையில்' as the location for all content, misattributing the Coimbatore city liquor arrests to Madukkarai.
  Caption text says Rajkumar 'சிறையில் அடைக்கப்பட்டார்' and the headline says 'பதுக்கியவர் சிறையில் அடைப்பு', while the article says 'சிறையில் அடைத்தனர்' without a clear subject; the headline's framing is an inference.
